    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Description\n\nThank you for mini.pick! After installing I noticed my config broke somewhat. The `setup` function creates keymaps that are not configurable. I have mapped `Q` in normal mode to `:bd!`. This broke after using this module.\n\nIt would be very nice to be able to override this :)\n",
